/**
 * @file src/AnalysisG/modules/roc/include/plotting/roc.h
 * @brief Header file for Receiver Operating Characteristic (ROC) curve plotting.
 * 
 * Contains the roc class and associated data structures for calculating and plotting 
 * ROC curves from model scores and truth labels.
 * 
 * @struct roc_t
 * @brief Structure containing raw and processed ROC curve data.
 * 
 * Stores the target class (`cls`), cross-validation fold (`kfold`), model name,
 * Area Under Curve (`_auc`), True Positive Rate (`tpr_`), and False Positive Rate (`fpr_`).
 * Also retains pointers to the original truth labels and scores.
 * 
 * @class roc
 * @brief Class for generating and plotting ROC curves.
 * 
 * Inherits from the plotting class. It aggregates ROC data across multiple labels
 * and folds, providing tools to build the ROC objects dynamically:
 * - `build_ROC`: Computes and caches the ROC metrics for a given model/name and fold.
 * - `get_ROC`: Returns the generated ROC structures for rendering.
 */
